      { title: "A Change to the Meeting", text: "At 3:20, Nisa phones her classmate Bora. ‘Hello, may I speak to Bora, please?’ she asks. His sister says he is doing his homework. Nisa explains that she is calling about the science-club meeting. It is at four o'clock, but the room has changed to the library. She asks Bora to bring his notebook. His sister says, ‘I'll give him the message.’ Nisa thanks her and says she will call back if Bora has a question.", questions: [["What is the call about?",["A birthday party","A science-club meeting","A football match","A lost phone"],1,"Nisa bilim kulübü toplantısı hakkında arıyor."],["Where is the meeting now?",["In the classroom","At the park","In the library","At Nisa's home"],2,"Yeni toplantı yeri kütüphane."],["What does Bora need to bring?",["His notebook","A recipe","A ball","A costume"],0,"Nisa Bora'dan defterini getirmesini istiyor."]] },
      { title: "A Clear Voicemail", text: "Hi, this is Deniz speaking. I'm calling about our English project. I can't meet at the café today because my little brother is ill. Could you tell Aylin that I can meet tomorrow at five at the library? Please ask her to bring the poster. You can call me back after six. My number is in our class group. Thanks, and speak to you soon!", questions: [["Why can't Deniz meet today?",["The library is closed.","His brother is ill.","He lost the poster.","He has a phone lesson."],1,"Deniz'in küçük kardeşi hasta."],["When can Deniz meet?",["Today at six","Tomorrow at five","Tomorrow at six","Today at five"],1,"Yarın saat beşte buluşmayı öneriyor."],["What should Aylin bring?",["A notebook","A cake","The poster","A phone"],2,"Mesajda posteri getirmesi söyleniyor."]] }
