    readings: [
      { title: "Mina's Internet Routine", text: "Mina uses the internet for about an hour after she finishes her homework. She often watches short science videos and searches for information for school projects. She sometimes chats with her cousins, but she never shares her password or home address. Mina takes a screen break after thirty minutes and keeps her phone outside her bedroom at night. If a message from a stranger makes her uncomfortable, she doesn't reply; she saves it and tells a trusted adult.", questions: [["When does Mina use the internet?",["Before school every morning","After finishing her homework","All night","During every lesson"],1,"Mina ödevini bitirdikten sonra internete giriyor."],["What does Mina never share?",["Science videos","Her password or home address","Her homework","Her screen time"],1,"Şifre ve ev adresini paylaşmıyor."],["What does she do about an uncomfortable message?",["She replies immediately.","She shares it with strangers.","She saves it and tells a trusted adult.","She posts her address."],2,"Güvenli davranış olarak kanıtı saklayıp güvendiği yetişkine söylüyor."]] },
      { title: "Before You Share", text: "A student sees a surprising story on a social-media page. The post has no writer's name and gives no source. Instead of sharing it, the student searches for the same information on a museum website and a science magazine. The details are different, so the student asks the teacher for help. The class learns to check the date, author and source before using online information. They also agree to write links in their projects.", questions: [["Why doesn't the student share the first post?",["It is too short.","It has no writer or source.","It is on a museum site.","The teacher wrote it."],1,"Yazar ve kaynak bilgisi bulunmuyor."],["Where does the student check the information?",["On a museum website and a science magazine","In a game chat","On a shopping page","Only on the first post"],0,"İki farklı güvenilir kaynağa bakıyor."],["What should students check before using information?",["The date, author and source","The page colour","The number of comments only","Their friend's password"],0,"Metin tarih, yazar ve kaynağın kontrolünü vurguluyor."]] }
    ],
